IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q13-CREDIT-SCORE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SCORE           PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-SCORE
EVALUATE TRUE
    WHEN WS-SCORE >= 300 AND WS-SCORE <= 579
        DISPLAY "Poor"
    WHEN WS-SCORE >= 580 AND WS-SCORE <= 669
        DISPLAY "Fair"
    WHEN WS-SCORE >= 670 AND WS-SCORE <= 739
        DISPLAY "Good"
    WHEN WS-SCORE >= 740 AND WS-SCORE <= 799
        DISPLAY "Very Good"
    WHEN WS-SCORE >= 800 AND WS-SCORE <= 850
        DISPLAY "Excellent"
    WHEN OTHER
        DISPLAY "INVALID SCORE"
END-EVALUATE
STOP RUN.
